<title>UK: Carlton group to redevelop Birmingham site.</title>
<headline>Carlton group to redevelop Birmingham site.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Carlton Communications Plc and Hampton Trust Plc said on Thursday that they plan to redevelop a six acre city centre site in Birmingham, in the English midlands.</p>
<p>The companies plan to develop the site into an international leisure destination and commercial development in excess of one million square feet with an end value of around 200 million stg.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
